          "git_sha": "c3b4dbdec07c22f27ffcc9f185d8996405548535",
          "line_end": 216,
          "line_start": 216,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "alexgreensh/outsourcerer",
          "url": "https://github.com/alexgreensh/outsourcerer/blob/0ad71828e1188dc5c90e1bbde57d28a748d76d0b/README.md#L216-L216"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_418bd44a22a6e1926c155a45fb94961719665bbd8826d2d4e3f51347dc54dcdd",
        "slc_e7398b4b9c8456a0c62c2dbf213e2dda892643db4001a47c71769a3f2d23031d"
      ],
      "text": "Delegates are watchdog-supervised to a classified end state (done / blocked / timed-out), with exit codes distinguishing done, done-but-unverified, and blocked, and stalled delegates killed rather than silently retried."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_90ddd792716c7c1436680b20d23f7600f124afb7a9f95b5c8e39c3dcb0c81381",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "0ad71828e1188dc5c90e1bbde57d28a748d76d0b",
          "git_sha": "c3b4dbdec07c22f27ffcc9f185d8996405548535",
          "line_end": 91,
          "line_start": 89,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "alexgreensh/outsourcerer",
          "url": "https://github.com/alexgreensh/outsourcerer/blob/0ad71828e1188dc5c90e1bbde57d28a748d76d0b/README.md#L89-L91"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b890714869b129ee8c37cda3c36b082985c9c878f44e287a0dfb12590b7a19d7"
      ],
      "text": "Advisor panels convene several strong models in parallel to review a plan or diff, and work is greenlit only on consensus; a split decision is returned to the user."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_68c1220a2a0a7d6c4d5bdce2eea7edde21e6fd2dfdcf975b6d38b5dfd80918c1",
