        "slc_4c8f7cb73d3f4e7f47f57829b2a172807dbaa2b619d6fcfa2bd3c907cc5dd65e"
      ],
      "text": "The fleet view currently covers only Claude Code sessions and Outsourcerer's own jobs; seeing sessions launched by other tools is listed as future work."
